+  - **Naismith** (default): 5 km/h on the flat plus one hour for every 600 m of
+    ascent; descent adds nothing.
+  - **Tobler** (`pace.tobler_kmh`): a leg takes its length divided by the speed on its
+    grade, where the speed is `6 * exp(-3.5 * |grade + 0.05|)` km/h and grade is the
+    leg's elevation change over its horizontal length (rise over run, so descents
+    count too). A zero-length leg takes no time. The summary time is the sum of the
